^"wonders"{
 what_is_the_comma_for: "If ; and || already part a strip from lanes, what is left for the comma: company whose order says nothing, a third kind of time, or only a layout?"
 may_a_mark_be_a_side: "Is a join only ever between two operands, or may a bare mark stand as one side of a bond, a seat a host fills later?"
 is_a_crossing_a_chord: "If the stretch two labeled spans share is the overlap, does the gap go back to its own card unburdened, and is the order of ends (end A; end B) enough for a listener to hear a crossing?"
 does_a_yield_belong_with_pivots: "Is a step that yields a value a second family beside the pivots, one allowed to lose a name, and should primed to actualized be one turn on a host's dial?"
 which_is_the_back_edge: "Is the way back the name (@loop, a reference today), the label (^_A, a labeled operation today), or neither until a loop can say when it ends?"
 should_said_and_counted_agree: "A trailing mark, a leading underscore and the fused #! each pass as read while a listener loses a distinction; should what is counted unread be what a listener could not tell apart?"
}

